{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>משדד</b> — a verb; likewise <b>יבריח</b> [will put to flight]: the meaning is that a son who causes shame to his father is commanded to drive away [him], and it brings about that his mother flees." "<b>מביש</b> — he brings shame upon his father."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:42.838145633Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}